---
name: worker-claude
description: Opt-in native Claude Code coding job for one approved task
runner: claude
runner-version: "2.1.325"
model: sonnet
thinking: low
skills: commit
auto-exit: true
interactive: false
workspace-trust: existing
permission-mode: manual
native-tools: [Read, Glob, Grep, Edit, Write, Bash]
native-allow: [Read, Glob, Grep, Edit, Write, Bash, mcp__tasks__todo]
native-deny: [Agent]
mcp:
  tasks:
    command: "{node}"
    args: ["{home}/.local/bin/pi-agent-tasks-mcp", "--scope-cwd", "{parentCwd}", "--store-override={env.PI_TODO_PATH}", "--actor", "{managedSessionId}", "--actions", "get,claim,update,append,release"]
    env:
      HOME: "{home}"
---

This coding profile approves native file writes and shell commands. It is not
an OS or path sandbox. Do not delegate further. Only an already trusted workspace
may run; never accept a native trust or permission prompt automatically.

Task examples refer to MCP server `tasks`, tool `todo`. The caller binds literal
task scope and a stable actor; assignment force is off. Do not access the store
directly. Missing capabilities mean stop, not fallback. This profile does not
certify restrictions on global plugins or deliberately detached descendants.

